       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TPOCLNUP.
       AUTHOR.        CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  MAY 1996.
       INSTALLATION.  THE GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.

      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *   T P O C L N U P                                          *
      *                                                            *
      *   THIS PROGRAM DELETES OLD RECORDS FROM THE PURCHASE ORDER *
      *   AUDIT FILE (MCFPCS5600).  IT DELETES RECORDS OLDER THAN  *
      *   6 MONTHS.                                                *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************
      *  CHANGES:
      *C
      *C   9/24/99    CA YODER    VALLEYFIELD REQ.
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO USE FIELD IN MPLTINFO TO SPECIFY A
      *C     LONGER PERIOD OF TIME TO RETAIN PO AUDIT RECORDS.
      *C


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPOTRACK-IO
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  DPOTRACK-IO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOTRACK-REC-IO.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS5601.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  NUM-MONTHS                   PIC 99.

      **************************************************************
      **      S W I T C H E S  &  H O L D   A R E A S             **
      **************************************************************

       01  DPOTRACK-EOF-SW           PIC X    VALUE "N".

       01  CURRENT-DATE.
           10  CUR-YY                PIC XX.
           10  CUR-MM                PIC XX.
           10  CUR-DD                PIC XX.

       01  DELETE-DATE.
           05  DEL-CC                PIC XX.
           05  DEL-YY                PIC XX.
           05  DEL-MM                PIC XX.
           05  FILLER                PIC XX  VALUE "01".

       01  HOLD-MM                   PIC S99.
       01  HOLD-YEAR.
           05  HOLD-CC               PIC 99.
           05  HOLD-YY               PIC 99.
       01  HOLD-YEAR-R    REDEFINES  HOLD-YEAR
                                     PIC 9(4).

       01  RECS-DEL                  PIC 9(6)  VALUE 0.
       01  PLT-ARG                   PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACE.

      **************************************************************
      **          D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                 **
      **************************************************************

       01  BUF-DPOTRACK.
       COPY DPOTRACK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLT0    IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLTPODL IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.

       COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **         P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N              **
      **************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           IF DPOTRACK-EOF-SW = "N"
               PERFORM 6-MAIN UNTIL (DPOTRACK-EOF-SW = "Y").
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O                 DPOTRACK-IO
                INPUT               MPLTINFO-I.

           PERFORM 999-READ-MPLTINFO.

      *------- CALCULATE CUTOFF DATE FOR DELETE.
           ACCEPT CURRENT-DATE      FROM DATE.
           MOVE CUR-MM              TO  HOLD-MM.
           MOVE CUR-YY              TO  HOLD-YY.
           IF CUR-YY > "70"
               MOVE 19              TO  HOLD-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20              TO  HOLD-CC.

           SUBTRACT NUM-MONTHS      FROM HOLD-MM.
           PERFORM UNTIL HOLD-MM > 0
               ADD 12               TO  HOLD-MM
               SUBTRACT 1           FROM HOLD-YEAR-R
           END-PERFORM.

           MOVE HOLD-MM             TO  DEL-MM.
           MOVE HOLD-CC             TO  DEL-CC.
           MOVE HOLD-YY             TO  DEL-YY.

           DISPLAY "DELETE DATE:  " DELETE-DATE.

           PERFORM 999-READ-NEXT-DPOTRACK.

       2-EOJ.
           DISPLAY "** NUMBER OF RECORDS DELETED:  " RECS-DEL.
           CLOSE                    DPOTRACK-IO.

       6-MAIN.
           IF TPO-DATE-STAMP-CN < DELETE-DATE
               PERFORM 60-DELETE-RECORD.

           PERFORM 999-READ-NEXT-DPOTRACK.

       60-DELETE-RECORD.
           DELETE DPOTRACK-IO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DELETE DPOTRACK ERROR IN 60-DELETE"
                                    TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.
           ADD 1                    TO  RECS-DEL.

      ************************************************************
      **                 F I L E   R E A D S                    **
      ************************************************************

       999-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PODL"       TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2" OR MPLTINFO-PURCH-DEL-MTH NOT NUMERIC
                                  OR MPLTINFO-PURCH-DEL-MTH = 0
               MOVE 6                  TO NUM-MONTHS
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 999-READ-MPLTINFO"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "PODL"             TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PURCH-DEL-MTH  TO  NUM-MONTHS.

       999-READ-NEXT-DPOTRACK.
           READ DPOTRACK-IO NEXT INTO BUF-DPOTRACK
               AT END MOVE "Y"      TO  DPOTRACK-EOF-SW.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00" AND DPOTRACK-EOF-SW = "N"
               MOVE "READ DPOTRACK ERROR IN 999-READ-NEXT-DRELTRAK"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE FILE-STATUS        TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 999-BLOWUP.

       999-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

